[{"answer":"It is the first school dance that I have ever been to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/1.mp3"},{"answer":"All of the boys are standing on one side of the gymnasium,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and all of the girls are on the other side.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/3.mp3"},{"answer":"There is loud music playing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/4.mp3"},{"answer":"and I can hardly hear my friends talking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/5.mp3"},{"answer":"The music is going fast,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and some people are starting to move to the beat of the song.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Soon all the girls are dancing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/8.mp3"},{"answer":"but the boys are still standing against the wall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Then the song ends, and slow music comes on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know what to do, so I just go and stand against the wall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Then one of the boys in my class comes over","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and asks me if I would like to dance to the slow song.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I really feel awkward and nervous, but say yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/14.mp3"},{"answer":"We go out into the middle of the gym,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/15.mp3"},{"answer":"and he puts his hands on my waist,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/16.mp3"},{"answer":"and I put my hands on his shoulders.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/17.mp3"},{"answer":"We start to move to the music, and we step on each other's feet!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/18.mp3"},{"answer":"He is bigger than me, so my toe starts to hurt a little bit!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/19.mp3"},{"answer":"As we continue to \"slow dance\",","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/20.mp3"},{"answer":"more boys and girls come to the middle of the gym to dance together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/21.mp3"},{"answer":"It sure is funny to watch people dance","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/22.mp3"},{"answer":"because they are stepping on each other's toes and bumping into each other","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and turning in opposite directions!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Soon the song ends, and the boys go to one side of the gym again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/25.mp3"},{"answer":"The girls decide that they want to dance to a fast song,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/26.mp3"},{"answer":"so they stay in the middle of the gym and dance with one another.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Our teachers are making sure that we are behaving because they are watching us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder if they want to dance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/29.mp3"},{"answer":"They probably are remembering their first school dance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder if someday I'll be grown up just like the teachers","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/31.mp3"},{"answer":"and laughing at the memories of my first school dance?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I sure hope so!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/137-school-dance-2019-04-07-04-24-46/33.mp3"}]
